#EXTM3U
# QA fixture (UTF-8, LF): names and groups outside ASCII (docs/QA.md, TC-PARSE-UNI-*).
#  - Latin diacritics fold to ASCII in searchKey (Télé Québec -> tele quebec, Łódź -> lodz, ß -> ss)
#  - Cyrillic, Arabic, CJK are kept intact and lowercased where applicable
#  - non-ASCII punctuation (en dash U+2013) is NOT folded by design; only ASCII punctuation collapses
#  - precomposed (NFC) vs decomposed (NFD) e-acute: only NFC folds today (see D-QA-08)
#  - an emoji (astral plane, 4-byte UTF-8) must round-trip through channels.json and the fnv1a32 id
#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="tele.quebec" group-title="Québec",Télé Québec
http://stream.example.test/tele-quebec.m3u8
